{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A resource-management adventure simulation game. In the new land of Terrarum, you will inherit a territory as a descendant of the Francz family and become the town mayor, tasked with settling artisans and adventurers. Together, you will build and expand the town.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>\u2014Develop Your Territory\u2014</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/extras/3580ac95c9cf75b2e94c882580af1f72.poster.avif?t=1757388185\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/extras/3580ac95c9cf75b2e94c882580af1f72.webm?t=1757388185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/extras/3580ac95c9cf75b2e94c882580af1f72.mp4?t=1757388185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the town from the ground up, establishing production chains in farming, industry, forestry, fishing, and livestock to restore its prosperity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>\u2014Recruit Residents\u2014</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/extras/7e611dda34646b3398b5a68c416917d1.poster.avif?t=1757388185\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/extras/7e611dda34646b3398b5a68c416917d1.webm?t=1757388185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/extras/7e611dda34646b3398b5a68c416917d1.mp4?t=1757388185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire hundreds of craftsmen and travelers, each with unique skills to help the town thrive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>\u2014Explore the World\u2014</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/extras/c123df1d49cf0f4dda91bc5852b6fb05.poster.avif?t=1757388185\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/extras/c123df1d49cf0f4dda91bc5852b6fb05.webm?t=1757388185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/extras/c123df1d49cf0f4dda91bc5852b6fb05.mp4?t=1757388185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send townsfolk on expeditions to uncover rare resources and treasures for your settlement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>\u2014More Features\u2014</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy diverse gameplay like vocational tournaments, guilds, world bosses, and more to enrich town life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864100?t=1757388185","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864100?t=1757388185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/1b5378a75099cb55a0e0b38b6c916703092aaa43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757388185","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864100/1b5378a75099cb55a0e0b38b6c916703092aaa43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757388185","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descri